1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,394
UltraEdge pe jo spike dikhta hai — zaroori nahi woh bat ki awaaz ho.

2
00:00:03,876 --> 00:00:06,696
Pad, zameen, joota — sab spike bana sakte hain.

3
00:00:07,184 --> 00:00:08,988
Toh third umpire edge pakadta kaise hai?

4
00:00:09,555 --> 00:00:13,954
Jawab stumps ke andar chhupa hai — ek chhota microphone, stump mic.

5
00:00:14,365 --> 00:00:18,204
Woh har second hazaaron baar awaaz sunta hai, aur screen pe wave banti hai.

6
00:00:18,665 --> 00:00:20,218
Lekin sirf spike dekhna kaafi nahi.

7
00:00:20,614 --> 00:00:24,509
Bat ka edge ek patla, nukila spike banata hai — bas ek pal ka.

8
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:27,728
Pad ya zameen ki awaaz moti aur faili hui hoti hai.

9
00:00:28,234 --> 00:00:29,699
Ab asli game — timing.

10
00:00:30,271 --> 00:00:32,439
Wave ko video se frame by frame milaate hain.

11
00:00:32,818 --> 00:00:36,469
Spike theek usi frame pe chahiye, jab ball bat ke bagal se guzarti hai.

12
00:00:36,891 --> 00:00:38,897
Ball bat tak pahunchi hi nahi, aur spike aa gaya?

13
00:00:39,319 --> 00:00:41,251
Matlab awaaz kahin aur ki thi.

14
00:00:41,769 --> 00:00:42,690
Par yahan ek problem hai.

15
00:00:43,097 --> 00:00:48,887
Audio aur video ka sync sirf das millisecond hila — aur ek sau chaalees ki ball, chaalees centimeter aage nikal gayi.

16
00:00:49,360 --> 00:00:53,192
Aur bahut patla edge itna halka hota hai, ki crowd ke shor mein dab jaata hai.

17
00:00:53,607 --> 00:00:56,956
Isiliye kabhi seedhi line pe bhi out milta hai — kyunki deflection dikha.

18
00:00:57,396 --> 00:00:59,984
Agli baar yaad rakhna — spike sirf awaaz hai.

19
00:01:00,360 --> 00:01:01,657
Sach timing batati hai.
